": "text", "uuid": "1AToULPxxu", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 30, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8917126, "raw_content": "Yep.  That was the Selzer and Company Poll, otherwise known as the GOLD standard in Iowa.\n\nIt was released on November 2, 2024.  The Election was a mere 3 days later and the results were as follows:\n\nDJT 55.7%\n\nWord Salad 42.5%\n\nShortly there after Anne Selzer quietly retired, effectively saying \"oops\" we missed it.\n\nOf course, it was not a miss.  No, Selzer and Co had no valid data.  They were a partisan organization that in desperation threw up an underthrown wobbly hail mary that at best would be intercepted.\n\nWas there coordination with the Harris Campaign?  You know the answer!", "author": "dataonly", "created": 1793628724396, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "SilverGolfer", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Selzer Poll, DesMoines Register-> Harris 47% - Trump 44%", "last_comment_created": 1793630644127, "content": "<p>Yep.  That was the Selzer and Company Poll, otherwise known as the GOLD standard in Iowa.</p>\n<p>It was released on November 2, 2024.  The Election was a mere 3 days later and the results were as follows:</p>\n<p>DJT 55.7%</p>\n<p>Word Salad 42.5%</p>\n<p>Shortly there after Anne Selzer quietly retired, effectively saying &quot;oops&quot; we missed it.</p>\n<p>Of course, it was not a miss.  No, Selzer and Co had no valid data.  They were a partisan organization that in desperation threw up an underthrown wobbly hail mary that at best would be intercepted.</p>\n<p>Was there coordination with the Harris Campaign?  You know the answer!</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": ""